      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Mixed-ability club night: keeping beginners and advanced players both happy</h1>
      <p class="lede">A wide ability spread is the reality at most club nights, and it is the thing organisers wrestle with most. Get it right and everyone gets a good game. Get it wrong and your beginners drift off while your strongest players quietly look elsewhere.</p>
